              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo ibumba lyalashikalipila, lyalasheba ukuti shitalale. Lelo shena elyo shacishamo ukupunda ashiti, “We Mfumu, we mwana Davidi, shi wingatulangulukilako!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
